---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Stop Babysitting Your Law Firm | Attorney Assistant"
  description="You built a team and grew the business — so why does everything still depend on you? Attorney Assistant brings structure to your firm so things get done without constant oversight."
  noindex={true}
  schema={{
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "Stop Babysitting Your Law Firm",
    "description": "Attorney Assistant brings structure and consistency to your firm's operations so you can stop micromanaging.",
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Attorney Assistant"
    }
  }}
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-950">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10 py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="mb-6">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold border border-brand-gold/20 backdrop-blur-sm">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-gold animate-pulse"></span>
              For Law Firm Owners
            </span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-display-md md:text-display-lg lg:text-display-xl font-heading text-white leading-tight mb-6">
            Stop Babysitting <span class="text-gradient-gold">Your Law Firm.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
            You hired adults. Built a team. Grew the business. So why does everything still depend on you checking that it got done?
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Free consultation
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              No commitment
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              We integrate with your team
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Booking Widget -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-white/10 reveal" style="transition-delay: 150ms" id="book-now">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="featured-icon featured-icon-md featured-icon-gold">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-xl font-heading text-gray-900">Book Your Call</h2>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Free &mdash; 30 minutes</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="meetings-iframe-container" data-src="https://meet.attorneyassistant.com/meetings/attorney-assistant/rr?embed=true&parentPageBackgroundColor=ffffff"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Opening — What It Feels Like -->
  <section class="lp-section bg-white">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal">
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          From the outside, your firm looks solid. Cases are coming in. Revenue is moving. The team is busy.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Then there's what it actually feels like to run it.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.28 7.22a.75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06L8.94 10l-1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06 1.06L10 11.06l1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06-1.06L11.06 10l1.72-1.72a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06L10 8.94 8.28 7.22z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
            <p class="text-gray-600">You're checking missed calls between meetings.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.28 7.22a.75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06L8.94 10l-1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06 1.06L10 11.06l1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06-1.06L11.06 10l1.72-1.72a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06L10 8.94 8.28 7.22z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
            <p class="text-gray-600">You're asking if anyone followed up.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.28 7.22a.75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06L8.94 10l-1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06 1.06L10 11.06l1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 101.06-1.06L11.06 10l1.72-1.72a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06L10 8.94 8.28 7.22z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
            <p class="text-gray-600">You're re-reading notes just to make sure nothing got dropped.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          And if you're being honest, you don't fully trust that things are handled unless you see it yourself.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg font-heading text-brand-navy">
          That's not leadership. That's babysitting with better clothes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Real Problem -->
  <section class="lp-section bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-navy/10 text-brand-navy border-brand-navy/15 mb-4">The Real Problem</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-xs md:text-display-sm font-heading text-gray-900 mb-6">
          Your team isn't the issue.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          They're working. They're trying. They care. But effort doesn't create consistency. What's missing is <strong class="text-gray-900">structure.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="lp-gap-grid">
          <div class="lp-gap-card">
            <div class="lp-gap-icon">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">How fast leads are handled</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-gap-card">
            <div class="lp-gap-icon">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 12c0-1.232-.046-2.453-.138-3.662a4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7-3.7 48.678 48.678 0 00-7.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7 3.7c-.017.22-.032.441-.046.662M19.5 12l3-3m-3 3l-3-3m-12 3c0 1.232.046 2.453.138 3.662a4.006 4.006 0 003.7 3.7 48.656 48.656 0 007.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 003.7-3.7c.017-.22.032-.441.046-.662M4.5 12l3 3m-3-3l-3 3" /></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">How often follow-up happens</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-gap-card">
            <div class="lp-gap-icon">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.752 15.002A9.718 9.718 0 0118 15.75c-5.385 0-9.75-4.365-9.75-9.75 0-1.33.266-2.597.748-3.752A9.753 9.753 0 003 11.25C3 16.635 7.365 21 12.75 21a9.753 9.753 0 009.002-5.998z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">What happens after hours</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-gap-card">
            <div class="lp-gap-icon">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0zM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0114.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0112 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 font-medium">Who owns what, and when</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-base text-gray-500 mt-8 leading-relaxed">
          So things slip. Not dramatically. Just enough to cost you cases. And just often enough that you feel like you have to stay on top of everything.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Cost -->
  <section class="lp-section bg-white">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-red-50 text-red-600 border-red-200 mb-4">The Cost</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-xs md:text-display-sm font-heading text-gray-900 mb-8">
          It's happening quietly.
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="lp-cost-row">
            <div class="lp-cost-icon lp-cost-icon--red">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 01-7.143-7.143c-.162-.441.004-.928.38-1.21l1.293-.97c.363-.271.527-.734.417-1.173L6.963 3.102a1.125 1.125 0 00-1.091-.852H4.5A2.25 2.25 0 002.25 4.5v2.25z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-base font-heading text-gray-900">Every missed call</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">is a potential client who hired someone else.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-cost-row">
            <div class="lp-cost-icon lp-cost-icon--amber">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-base font-heading text-gray-900">Every slow follow-up</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">is a lead that went cold.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-cost-row">
            <div class="lp-cost-icon lp-cost-icon--navy">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18.75a60.07 60.07 0 0115.797 2.101c.727.198 1.453-.342 1.453-1.096V18.75M3.75 4.5v.75A.75.75 0 013 6h-.75m0 0v-.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125H20.25M2.25 6v9m18-10.5v.75c0 .414.336.75.75.75h.75m-1.5-1.5h.375c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v9.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-.375m1.5-1.5H21a.75.75 0 00-.75.75v.75m0 0H3.75m0 0h-.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V15m1.5 1.5v-.75A.75.75 0 003 15h-.75M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm3 0h.008v.008H18V10.5zm-12 0h.008v.008H6V10.5z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-base font-heading text-gray-900">Every gap in coverage</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">is money you already paid for&hellip; gone.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-base text-gray-500 mt-8 leading-relaxed">
          No alerts. No big warning. Just lost opportunities you never even see.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Enter Attorney Assistant -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-950 lp-section">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-20 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-gold/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-10 right-1/3 w-80 h-80 bg-brand-blue/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-narrow relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-white/10 text-white/80 border-white/10 mb-4">The Fix</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-xs md:text-display-sm font-heading text-white mb-6">
          We fix the part of your firm that should not require <span class="text-gradient-gold">constant supervision.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-10">
          Attorney Assistant steps in and brings structure to what's currently inconsistent.
        </p>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="lp-what-card">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z" /></svg>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/90">Respond to new leads quickly so they don't disappear</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-what-card">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 12c0-1.232-.046-2.453-.138-3.662a4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7-3.7 48.678 48.678 0 00-7.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7 3.7c-.017.22-.032.441-.046.662M19.5 12l3-3m-3 3l-3-3m-12 3c0 1.232.046 2.453.138 3.662a4.006 4.006 0 003.7 3.7 48.656 48.656 0 007.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 003.7-3.7c.017-.22.032-.441.046-.662M4.5 12l3 3m-3-3l-3 3" /></svg>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/90">Follow up consistently instead of once or twice and hoping</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-what-card">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.752 15.002A9.718 9.718 0 0118 15.75c-5.385 0-9.75-4.365-9.75-9.75 0-1.33.266-2.597.748-3.752A9.753 9.753 0 003 11.25C3 16.635 7.365 21 12.75 21a9.753 9.753 0 009.002-5.998z" /></svg>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/90">Cover the gaps when your team is unavailable</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-what-card">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18 18.72a9.094 9.094 0 003.741-.479 3 3 0 00-4.682-2.72m.94 3.198l.001.031c0 .225-.012.447-.037.666A11.944 11.944 0 0112 21c-2.17 0-4.207-.576-5.963-1.584A6.062 6.062 0 016 18.719m12 0a5.971 5.971 0 00-.941-3.197m0 0A5.995 5.995 0 0012 12.75a5.995 5.995 0 00-5.058 2.772m0 0a3 3 0 00-4.681 2.72 8.986 8.986 0 003.74.477m.94-3.197a5.971 5.971 0 00-.94 3.197M15 6.75a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0zm-13.5 0a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0z" /></svg>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/90">Support your existing team so things actually get done</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why This Works -->
  <section class="lp-section bg-white">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/10 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-4">Why This Works</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-xs md:text-display-sm font-heading text-gray-900 mb-6">
          We don't act like an outside vendor.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          We don't drop in, do tasks, and disappear. We integrate into your firm.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-5">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50/50">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-navy/8 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-navy" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.036 12.322a1.012 1.012 0 010-.639C3.423 7.51 7.36 4.5 12 4.5c4.638 0 8.573 3.007 9.963 7.178.07.207.07.431 0 .639C20.577 16.49 16.64 19.5 12 19.5c-4.638 0-8.573-3.007-9.963-7.178z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-base font-heading text-gray-900">We learn how you operate.</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Your workflows, your expectations, your standards.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50/50">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-navy/8 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-navy" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.19 8.688a4.5 4.5 0 011.242 7.244l-4.5 4.5a4.5 4.5 0 01-6.364-6.364l1.757-1.757m13.35-.622l1.757-1.757a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364l-4.5 4.5a4.5 4.5 0 001.242 7.244" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-base font-heading text-gray-900">We align with your expectations.</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Not a generic playbook. Your firm's way of doing things.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50/50">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-navy/8 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-navy" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18 18.72a9.094 9.094 0 003.741-.479 3 3 0 00-4.682-2.72m.94 3.198l.001.031c0 .225-.012.447-.037.666A11.944 11.944 0 0112 21c-2.17 0-4.207-.576-5.963-1.584A6.062 6.062 0 016 18.719m12 0a5.971 5.971 0 00-.941-3.197m0 0A5.995 5.995 0 0012 12.75a5.995 5.995 0 00-5.058 2.772m0 0a3 3 0 00-4.681 2.72 8.986 8.986 0 003.74.477m.94-3.197a5.971 5.971 0 00-.94 3.197M15 6.75a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0zm-13.5 0a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-base font-heading text-gray-900">We become part of your team.</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Because if it doesn't fit your culture, it won't stick. And if it doesn't stick, you're right back where you started.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What Changes -->
  <section class="lp-section bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 border-emerald-200 mb-4">What Changes</span>
